+// Facet status bar icon modes. Mode 0, every icon as stock Android shows them,
+// is the `else` branch below and needs no constant.
+/** Facet: show only alerting notifications, hiding silent and ambient ones. */
+private const val FACET_ICONS_ALERTING = 1
+/** Facet: show a single icon for the most recent notification. */
+private const val FACET_ICONS_SINGLE = 2
+/** Facet: show no notification icons at all. */
+private const val FACET_ICONS_HIDDEN = 3
+
 /** View-model for the row of notification icons displayed in the status bar, */
